R1 fixes (2026-10-28)
- F1: CaptureService::start() spawns each sensor thread, which applies its ThreadConfig and THEN calls
  backend->start() itself (Status back via std::promise); backends start in parallel; on failure the started
  ones are stopped, threads joined, hubs closed. Backend-internal threads inherit affinity / SCHED_FIFO / nice.
  spdlog registry is constructed in start() before any thread (TSan false positive on concurrent first use of
  the uninstrumented libspdlog static). New test BackendStartRunsWithTheConfiguredPlacement (fake start() and a
  thread it creates both observe cpus {0}, nice 5). ThreadPlacement test now pins a scratch thread, not gtest's.
- F7: imu.driver.{timestamp_decimation (1|8|32), temperature_batch_hz (0|1.6|12.5|52), fifo_burst_words
  (1..512), pair_by_tag_counter} and imu.driver.clock.outlier_gate_ns (0..1e9) are read, validated, written by
  to_yaml (so in content_hash) and documented in the example yaml. Test NewImuKeysAreReadHashedAndBudgeted.
- F8: poll budget = (odr * (2 + 1/timestamp_decimation) + temperature_batch_hz) * poll_s words, < 50 % of 512.
- F13: DS13345 -> DS12814 in rig_config_load.cpp (no other T3 file had it).
- F14: layout::kFramesDir = "data" (EuRoC cam0/data/); session.cpp + tests use the constant.
- F15: common/config/sensor_modes.{hpp,cpp} deleted; the validator uses T2's known_sensor_modes() and
  mode_supports_fps(). Rule: ultrawide = full_fov AND aspect of the full array; main = T2 full_fov (16:9 field),
  1280x720 on imx519 is an error unless sensor_mode >= 0. Messages list modes in T2's table order
  ("full-FOV modes are 3280x2464@21, 1640x1232@30"). Test MainMustCoverTheFull169FieldUnlessForced.
- test_rig_config no longer hard-codes accel_noise_density (T1 F9 owns the value).
- FromRigConfigWithMockBackends: under TSan only, steady state is not asserted (T2's full-size NV12 mock runs
  below rate under TSan on a loaded machine); delivery + zero overflows still asserted.
- One unreproduced TSan failure of StreamHub.StressManyConsumersBothPolicies during a load-average-24 run
  (no output captured; possibly memory pressure: 200k-slot queue + TSan shadow). 10+ reruns incl.
  ctest --repeat until-fail:3 under -j20 all PASS. Reviewer: watch for it.
